#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:5
msgid "Simple element"
msgstr "简单元素"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:7
msgid ""
"The simple element is used to represent devices such actuators (electric "
"motors, cylinders, pneumatic or hydraulic valves, etc.), control devices "
"(PLC, Microcontrollers, etc.), circuit breakers, etc."
msgstr "简单的元件用于代表此类起动器(电动机，气缸，气压阀或液压阀等),控制装置(PLC,微控制器等),断路器等。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech simple element"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 简单元素"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:16
msgid "For simple element exist two type of variables:"
msgstr "对于简单的元素存在两种类型的变量："

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:18
msgid ""
"General variables common for all type of elements and managed internally by "
"QElectroTech."
msgstr "所有类型元素通用的普通变量，由QEelectroTech内部管理。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:19
msgid "Specific variables from simple elements."
msgstr "来自简单元素的特定变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:21
msgid "General variables"
msgstr "一般变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:23
msgid "**% {F}**: Label from the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {F}**:从可找到元素的圆柱处划出标签"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:24
msgid "**% {f}**: Number from the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {f}**:可以找到元素的光圈中的数字"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:25
msgid ""
"**% {M}**: Plant variable from the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {M}**:可以找到元素的圆柱形的植物变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:26
msgid ""
"**% {LM}**: Location variable of the folio where the element can be found"
msgstr "**% {LM}**:可以找到元素的光圈位置变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:27
msgid ""
"**% {l}**: Folio line number from the workspace where the element can be "
"found"
msgstr "**% {l}**:可以找到元素的工作空间的Folio行号"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:28
msgid ""
"**% {c}**: Folio column number from the workspace where the element can be "
"found"
msgstr "**% {c}**:可以找到元素的工作空间的Folio列号"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:29
msgid "**% {id}**: Folio position in the project (Schema number)"
msgstr "**% {id}**:项目中的Folio位置(计划编号)"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:31
msgid "Specific variables"
msgstr "具体变量"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Label formula**: Definition of the formula which defines the **Label** "
"value. If a auto numbering pattern is selected during terminal creation, "
"QElectroTech defiens ``%autnum`` as default formula."
msgstr ""
"**标签公式**:定义定义 **标签** 值的公式。如果在终端创建过程中选择了自动编号模式，QEelectroTech defiens "
"``%autnum`` 作为默认公式。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Label**: Internal variable which is used to defines the element code."
msgstr "**标签**:用于定义元素代码的内部变量。"

#: ../../source/users/element/type/element_simple.rst:35
msgid ""
